sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Mem as Memtable
    participant WAL as Write-ahead log
    participant SST as SSTables on disk
    participant Cmp as Compaction
    App->>WAL: append the write durably
    App->>Mem: insert into the sorted in-memory table
    Note over Mem: the write is now complete — sequential only
    Mem->>SST: flush when full, immutable from here
    App->>SST: read key
    alt found in the memtable
        Mem-->>App: value
    else
        SST->>SST: check the bloom filter per level
        SST-->>App: value from the newest segment that has it
    end
    Cmp->>SST: merge levels, drop shadowed and deleted keys
    Note over Cmp: B-trees write in place — LSM trees write sequentially and pay at compaction
